                <head>Light and harbor dues in Zanzibar: treaty between the United States and Great
                    Britain</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, June 5, 1903.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, November 25, 1903.<lb/>Ratified by the President,
                        December 8, 1903.<lb/>Ratified by Great Britain, June 30,
                        1903.<lb/>Ratifications exchanged at Washington, December 24,
                        1903<lb/>Proclaimed, December 24, 1903.</hi></p>

